{"title":"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following numbers is farthest away from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> on a number line?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/c/ebc37665c6edf2bbaf4481c8b1c4878cad7f90b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -10 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -8 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"405\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can calculate the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Absolute_value\" title=\"Absolute value\">absolute value</a> of each number and then see which gives the largest absolute value:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/6/e569a8152ef40d2a704c637871bf5e31b69d11b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|-10| = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/9/af9c47368e9911641de6722bd09e48877b3029e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|-8| = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/8/9e801d5d12213c0134f420f33758f8f9b1264940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|3| = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/3/483c87fbb70a2197a35528bb3cf8f0ed4b0222d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|8| = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/4/71463ba5edd58af6885a599f82c2b015df7b359c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|9| = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>The number that had the largest absolute value was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7c4ac2c4ab05b50a8969cc3c5651364a418c6f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } -10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2<